 "context": "Demo: 9x9 background 4 with color-1 singleton markers at zero-based (2,1) and (7,6). Output fills diagonal between them: adds 1 at (3,2),(4,3),(5,4),(6,5), retaining markers. Test 19x16 has 1 positions (2,2),(4,14),(10,10),(17,9); 6 positions (4,4),(6,6),(7,14),(15,2); background 4. Need infer operation and test result.",
